// Description: Detects network communication involving common industrial control system protocols including Modbus, DNP3, and IEC 60870-5-104
// Data Source: DeviceNetworkEvents
// Severity: Medium to High (Critical Infrastructure Context)
// MITRE ATT&CK: T0842 (Network Service Scanning), ICS-related reconnaissance techniques
// False Positives: Legitimate OT environments, industrial monitoring systems, engineering workstations

DeviceNetworkEvents
| where RemotePort in (502, 20000, 2404)
| project Timestamp, DeviceName, RemoteIP, RemotePort, InitiatingProcessAccountName, AdditionalFields
